{"source_id": "self-authored-v2-001", "rights": "self_authored", "reviewed_by": "dataset_author", "approved": true, "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "怎么判断模型是在死记硬背训练样本？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "用训练期间从未出现的独立问题测试模型，比较它的回答与基础模型的差异；如果只在见过的问题上表现好，就是死记硬背。"}], "note": "Targeted at round-2 sft-019 failure (off-topic answer); direct answer, no repetition."}
{"source_id": "self-authored-v2-002", "rights": "self_authored", "reviewed_by": "dataset_author", "approved": true, "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "死记硬背和真正学会有什么区别？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "死记硬背只能复述见过的答案，换个问法就答错；真正学会能泛化到新问题，回答与训练样本的措辞无关。"}], "note": "Targeted at sft-019 failure mode."}
{"source_id": "self-authored-v2-003", "rights": "self_authored", "reviewed_by": "dataset_author", "approved": true, "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "为什么独立评测集必须来自训练集之外？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "训练集里的样本模型已经见过，分数会虚高；只有训练时从未出现的问题才能反映真实能力。"}], "note": "Targeted at sft-019 failure mode."}
{"source_id": "self-authored-v2-004", "rights": "self_authored", "reviewed_by": "dataset_author", "approved": true, "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "微调后模型在某些问题上变差说明什么？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "说明模型拟合了训练分布而牺牲了通用能力；应记录退化样本类型，扩充数据或降低训练强度后重训。"}], "note": "Targeted at round-2 regression finding."}
{"source_id": "self-authored-v2-005", "rights": "self_authored", "reviewed_by": "dataset_author", "approved": true, "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "断电后多代理任务怎么继续？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "把任务状态、输入和产物持久化保存，重启后读取最后的完成标记，从下一个未完成步骤继续。"}], "note": "Targeted at round-2 sft-020 failure (repetition loop); direct answer."}
{"source_id": "self-authored-v2-006", "rights": "self_authored", "reviewed_by": "dataset_author", "approved": true, "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "程序崩溃后为什么要从检查点恢复？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "检查点保存了已完成步骤的状态；从检查点继续避免重复已成功的工作，节省时间并保证结果一致。"}], "note": "Targeted at sft-020 failure mode."}
{"source_id": "self-authored-v2-007", "rights": "self_authored", "reviewed_by": "dataset_author", "approved": true, "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "模型生成回答时出现重复循环怎么处理？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "这是退化信号，说明训练数据或强度有问题；应检查数据是否有重复样本，必要时降低学习率或减少轮数重训。"}], "note": "Targeted at sft-020 failure mode; teaches the model to recognize its own degeneration."}
{"source_id": "self-authored-v2-008", "rights": "self_authored", "reviewed_by": "dataset_author", "approved": true, "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "怎样检测生成文本里的重复循环？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "统计短语在一段回答里出现的次数；同一个短语重复三次以上就视为退化，自动评估脚本应标记该样本。"}], "note": "Targeted at sft-020 failure mode."}
