{"source_id": "self-authored-v2-010", "rights": "self_authored", "reviewed_by": "dataset_author", "approved": true, "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "损失下降但回答质量变差可能吗？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "可能；损失只衡量对训练数据的拟合，不衡量通用质量，所以必须逐样本人工判读再加自动退化检测。"}], "note": "Encodes the round-2 core lesson (eval_loss vs quality inconsistency)."}
